          "Oot3d_AudioRequestFlag100 stores sfxId at request state offset 0x28 before callback registration",
          "the request-state pointer literal at 0x00465368 is 0x0054ABD4",
          "referenced object id offset is 0x9C and pending byte offset is 0x04",
          "the status comparison is unsigned and accepts values 0 through 12",
          "the saved r3 word and local handle occupy the same stack address"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "The names RendererObjectRef and RendererObjectHandle remain provisional structural types; retain the exact target offsets and helper calls if their final domain names change.",
